---
name: fmt-indentation
description: Formatter vector fmt-indentation.
engine: 0.2.0-lab.1
roles: [lead, reviewers]
extensions: [host.presence/1]
---
contract @30m => expired
type reviewer: agent
	specialty: enum(devops|general)
reviewers: list(reviewer)
type review
        text: text(1..100)
type ping
type stop
state new
lead -> reviewers: ping() => reviewing
state reviewing
      event reviewers -> lead: ping()
collect reports from reviewers -> lead @5m => done
reply review()
            offline @30s
anystate
lead -> reviewers: stop() => done
end done
